Add your publications below in BibTeX format. jekyll-scholar renders this
file automatically on the /publications/ page, grouped by year. See
CUSTOMIZE.md ("Publications") for the full list of supported fields.

Tips:
  - Set selected=true on an entry to feature it on the About page.
  - Add abbr={...} for a short venue badge (e.g. abbr={arXiv}).
  - Add pdf={filename.pdf} (place the file in assets/pdf/) or
    html={https://...} to link to the paper.
  - Your own name (as configured in _config.yml under scholar:) is
    automatically bolded in the author list.
